      "writtenOn": "2019-05-13T17:52:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I imagined we want this change because we can use IS_ENABLED for macros with numeric values. For example, if we accept 2, we can do:\n\n  if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_USB_PD_PORT_COUNT))\n    ...;\n\nIsn\u0027t it just a matter of adding __ARG_PLACEHOLDER_2? If we\u0027re accepting only 1, how would it be useful?",
