      "writtenOn": "2019-05-13T21:08:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added 0 and 1 because in the KConfig world all defines are set to 1 when set. So I was just trying to make that work. I feel like 0 and 1 are accepted magic values. If we start adding random magic values I think that just makes things confusing. If you feel strongly, I can remove 0 and 1 support. The real goal of this CL was to throw an error on an unknown value.",
      "parentUuid": "8e67f5f6_b606a3d8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 263,
        "startChar": 15,
        "endLine": 263,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "5172d04a8d91ce7d7b56941d1ffe3dd0e7239f6d",
