        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-13T21:46:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest we keep it simple: #define CONFIG_X (without assignment) for IS_ENABLE. Accepting CONFIG_X\u003d1 will create inconsistency (between existing CONFIG_* and between \u003d1 v.s. \u003d2).",
